PLACEHOLDER — replace this file with your device certificate.

Copy the PEM produced by samples/common/scripts/Initialize-AduSampleEnvironment.ps1
(adu-sim-device-cert.pem) here, or generate your own X.509 client certificate
whose CN matches CONFIG_ADU_DPS_REGISTRATION_ID. The contents must be a single
PEM block:

-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
...base64...
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
